  "description": "DAJVAP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C42 H54 B4 N28 O15 Pr4. From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 4 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 4 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 4 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.762-3.790 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.48-110.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C42H54B4N28O15Pr4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
